WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:04.403
-It is time for "Tonight Show"
hashtags, everybody.

00:00:04.403 --> 00:00:06.306
♪ -Hashtags ♪

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.011
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:17.250
-Hey, we do this thing every
week where I send out a hashtag

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.351
and we ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:21.421
So with the DNC convention
happening right now,

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:24.323
I asked you guys to tweet out
a funny campaign slogan

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:26.459
and tag it with
#mycampaignslogan.

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.427
Within five minutes,
it was a trending topic.

00:00:28.427 --> 00:00:30.529
So thank you for playing along.
I appreciate it.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:33.299
Now I thought I'd share some of
my favorite #mycampaignslogan

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.067
responses from you guys.

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:38.004
This first one is
from @noseworthyann.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:41.941
She says, "What happens in 2020
stays in 2020."

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:45.444
Viva Las Vaccine.

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:47.880
This one is from @richierich39.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.216
He says,
"I passed my cognitive test."

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:53.286
Oh, I'll vote for that.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:56.222
I know elephants and giraffes.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:59.458
This one is from @danvan03.

00:00:59.458 --> 00:01:01.760
He says, "Everyone reaches
that moment when you interrupt

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.229
that uncle at the dinner table.

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.031
America, this is that moment."

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:06.298
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.298 --> 00:01:08.368
That's a beautiful speech.

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:11.437
This one is from @womack717.

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:14.941
She says, "Let's not find out
if rock bottom has a basement."

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:17.310
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:18.844
I like that, too.

00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:20.947
No one wants to know that.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:23.449
This one is from @mayhemwp.

00:01:23.449 --> 00:01:25.618
He says, "Vote for me
and I'll add you

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:27.587
to my 'Selling Sunset'
text chain."

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.922
Oh, that's --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.922 --> 00:01:33.526
Sorry, I'm already busy
with my "Below Deck" chat, so...

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:37.030
Did see what happened to Hannah?
Mm, mm, mm, mm.

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.198
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:42.602
This one is from @trulykhayyam.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:46.172
He says, "You've tried Trump and
Pence. Now try common sense."

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:47.740
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:49.375
That rhymes.

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:53.413
This one is
from @apewillshowers.

00:01:53.413 --> 00:01:55.347
-What?

00:01:55.347 --> 00:01:57.917
-Yeah, ape will showers.
-Ah.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:01.120
-So, yeah. Like April showers
but ape -- I don't get it.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.789
It's --

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:04.090
Yeah, I do.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:05.291
It's April.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.859
It's apewill.

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.327
-I thought he was trying
to be cute.

00:02:08.327 --> 00:02:10.129
-I think it's just cute, yeah.

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:12.431
Yeah.
-Almost cute.

00:02:12.431 --> 00:02:16.502
It would have been cute
if showers was, you know,

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:19.305
ape will show-- "shorwers."

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.741
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:23.443
This close.

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:25.544
-What do you mean?

00:02:25.544 --> 00:02:27.280
It does say that.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.749
Ape will showers.
It says ape will showers.

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:33.119
-Yeah, but no,
if it said ape will shorwers.

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:35.421
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:37.156
-Shallers?

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:38.691
-That will work too.

00:02:38.691 --> 00:02:41.627
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.627 --> 00:02:45.397
-Ape will sh-- hours?

00:02:45.397 --> 00:02:46.398
-See it?

00:02:46.398 --> 00:02:47.433
-No.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:51.303
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.303 --> 00:02:52.839
I don't get it.

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:55.341
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.276
It's from @apewillshowers.

00:02:57.276 --> 00:03:00.046
She says, "America, blink twice
if you need help."

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:03.082
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:06.319
Here's the last one here.
It's from @fherron01.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:09.188
They say, "Alexa, 2020 off."

00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:10.823
Yeah. Please.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.823 --> 00:03:12.858
There you have it. Those are
our "Tonight Show" hashtags.

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:14.293
To check out
more of our favorites,

00:03:14.293 --> 00:03:16.896 line:0%
go to tonightshow.com/hashtags.

